<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  TEMPLATE ONLY - tracked in git, contains no real secret.

  To configure the JV AI LLM test:
    1. Copy this file to "Secrets.plist" in the same folder (HY16Probe/Secrets.plist).
    2. Replace OpenRouterAPIKey below with your real OpenRouter API key
       (from https://openrouter.ai/keys).
    3. Leave OpenRouterModelID as-is, or change it to any other OpenRouter
       model ID to test a different model - no code change needed.

  To configure the JV AI VoiceStudio TTS test:
    4. In the VoiceStudio app: Settings > Sharing & Remote Access (or the
       footer "Local" pill) > switch to "Network". This starts a SEPARATE
       LAN-facing server on port 3901 (verified live - NOT the same as
       the always-loopback-only port 3900 dev API) and shows a 6-digit
       share PIN plus the LAN address to use.
    5. Replace VoiceStudioBaseURL with http://<the address VoiceStudio
       shows you>:3901 (e.g. http://192.168.0.139:3901 - this can change
       if the Mac's IP changes, re-check in VoiceStudio's own UI). Do NOT
       use "localhost" - that means the iPhone itself, not the Mac. Do
       NOT use port 3900 for LAN access - verified unreachable from
       another device (loopback-only).
    6. Replace VoiceStudioModelID and VoiceStudioVoiceID with REAL,
       VERIFIED values from your running VoiceStudio instance (e.g. via
       GET <baseURL>/v1/audio/voices, or the VoiceStudio app's own UI) -
       these are UNVERIFIED PLACEHOLDERS below, not real values. Until
       replaced, VoiceStudioTTSService treats the configuration as
       incomplete and GlassesSpeakerTestController falls back to Apple
       TTS (speak(_:)) automatically.
    7. VoiceStudioPin is REQUIRED once Network mode is on (verified live:
       the shared port rejects requests with HTTP 401 without it) - copy
       the 6-digit PIN VoiceStudio's UI shows you. It changes each time
       Network mode is freshly enabled - update this file again if so.

  HY16Probe/Secrets.plist is listed in .gitignore and will never be
  committed. Neither OpenRouterAIService.swift nor VoiceStudioTTSService.swift
  ever logs the API key or PIN value.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>OpenRouterAPIKey</key>
	<string>REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_OPENROUTER_API_KEY</string>
	<key>OpenRouterModelID</key>
	<string>openai/gpt-5-nano</string>
	<key>VoiceStudioBaseURL</key>
	<string>http://REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_MAC_LAN_IP:3900</string>
	<key>VoiceStudioModelID</key>
	<string>REPLACE_WITH_VERIFIED_ENGINE_ID</string>
	<key>VoiceStudioVoiceID</key>
	<string>REPLACE_WITH_VERIFIED_VOICE_ID</string>
	<key>VoiceStudioPin</key>
	<string></string>
</dict>
</plist>
